    <title>Warden's Workshop | Master Craftsmanship Since 1976</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Warden's Workshop in Essex, ON offers 50 years of expert painting, home renovation, RV revitalization, and vintage technical restoration by master craftsman Tony Warden." />
    <meta name="keywords" content="painting contractor Essex ON, home renovation Essex, RV repair Ontario, vintage sewing machine restoration, Tony Warden, Warden's Workshop" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://wardensworkshop.ca/index.html" />
