    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content reveal">
        <h1>The Art of Restoration.</h1>
        <p>50 Years of Technical Expertise &amp; Professional Care in Essex</p>
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section container">
      <div class="split-layout">
        <div class="reveal">
          <img src="images/about-tony.jpg" alt="Master Craftsman Working" class="rounded-image shadow" />
        </div>
        <div class="reveal about-text">
          <div class="section-title left-align">
            <h2>Master Craftsmanship Since 1976</h2>
            <div class="underline"></div>
          </div>
          <p>
            For five decades, Tony Warden has dedicated his life to the pursuit
            of perfection. What started as a passion for vintage mechanics has
            evolved into a premier restoration and property renovation service.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Warden's Workshop, we don't just fix things—we honor their
            history. Whether we are bringing a 100-year-old sewing machine back
            to life or transforming your living space, every project is handled
            with obsessive care and surgical precision.
          </p>
          <a href="about.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 20px">Meet Tony Warden</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-warm">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title reveal">
          <h2>Specialized Expertise</h2>
          <div class="underline"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card reveal text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-paint-roller"></i>
            <h3>Home &amp; Property</h3>
            <p>
              Interior and exterior painting executed with surgical precision,
              custom trim, and premium materials.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-caravan"></i>
            <h3>RV Revitalization</h3>
            <p>
              From structural leak repair to full interior remodeling, we bring
              your mobile home back to life.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-tools"></i>
            <h3>Technical Repair</h3>
            <p>
              Specializing in the delicate restoration of vintage sewing
              machines and antique structural repairs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container">
      <div class="section-title reveal">
        <h2>Recent Work</h2>
        <div class="underline"></div>
        <p class="subtitle">A glimpse into the workshop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-grid reveal">
        <img src="images/gallery-1.jpg" alt="Wood Restoration" class="gallery-img" />
        <img src="images/gallery-2.jpg" alt="Exterior Painting" class="gallery-img" />
        <img src="images/gallery-3.jpg" alt="Vintage Sewing Machine" class="gallery-img" />
        <img src="images/gallery-4.jpg" alt="RV Interior" class="gallery-img" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-dark text-white text-center">
      <div class="container reveal">
        <i class="fas fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
        <p class="testimonial-text">
          "Tony's attention to detail is unmatched. He restored our vintage
          sewing machine that had been in the family for three generations. It
          runs like it's brand new."
        </p>
        <h4 class="testimonial-author">— Sarah J., Essex County</h4>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="container footer-content">
        <div class="footer-info">
          <img src="images/logo.png" alt="Warden's Workshop Logo" class="footer-logo" />
          <p>© 2026 Warden's Workshop<br />509-22 Victor Street, Essex, ON</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-contact">
          <h4>Contact Tony</h4>
          <p><i class="fas fa-phone"></i><a href="tel:1-888-488-0864">1-888-488-0864</a></p>
          <p><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i><a href="mailto:apwarden1@gmail.com">apwarden1@gmail.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="js/script.js"></script>
